      "id": "lk-journey",
      "type": "text",
      "width": "full",
      "heading": "From game jam to vertical slice",
      "body": "Lightkeeper began as Fell Out, a game-jam project about exploring a fog-covered archipelago and meeting its inhabitants.\n\nConcept funding from FFF Bayern in 2024 gave us room to develop the pitch and test a larger world. Prototype funding followed later that year. We explored traversal, gathering, progression, and character interaction, then narrowed the scope to reach a playable vertical slice.",
      "source": "",
      "mediaRef": "",
      "href": "",
      "label": "",
      "projectId": "",
      "alt": "",
      "fit": "cover"
